OL,5,G0245 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FMohammed is back about his swollen
OL,7,     Fleg, which is getting more painful
OL,8,     Fand now makes walking difficult.
OL,9,     FOther cases include a worrying
OL,10,     Farmpit lump, and long-term
OL,11,     Fdepression and anxiety.
